    "title": "Weekend Events in Jaipur (Dec 26-28)",
    "text": "• Amer Palace: Explore the 17th-century fort on December 28 from 3:30 PM to 6 PM. Entry starts at ₹699; registration via 95113-51360.\n• AP Dhillon Concert: Performance on December 28 at 6:30 PM at the Jaipur Exhibition and Convention Centre. Tickets start at ₹2,999 on bookmyshow.com.\n• Fusion Music Festival: Collaboration between Yarol Poupaud and Rahis Bharti's Dhoad group on December 26 at 6:30 PM at Rajasthan International Centre. Entry starts at ₹99 on bookmyshow.com.\n• In Memory of Ghalib: Musical poetry event on December 27 at 4 PM at Pink City Press Club auditorium. Entry starts at ₹199 on district.in.\n• Winter Flea Festival: Ongoing until December 26 at Birla Auditorium Statue Circle, Rambagh. Entry starts at ₹599 on thewinterflea.com.\n• Sambhar Festival: Five-day festival from December 27 to 31 in Sambhar. Details on utsav.gov.in.\n• Vipul Goyal Unleashed: Stand-up comedy show on December 27 at 6 PM at Harishchandra Totuka Bhawan. Tickets start at ₹899 on bookmyshow.com.",
